  "description": "Standalone web-based SQLite database admin UI — discover, browse, edit, query SQLite databases visually. Independent of CrudAdmin. v1.2.0 adds per-file read-only protection (ReadOnlyFiles — browse/query/export still work, writes are refused) and ExtraFiles, for showing specific database files that live outside the configured data folders. v1.1.0 adds a Global-Admin-only signed auto-login handoff (SqliteSsoService) so an already-authenticated CrudAdmin session can one-click into SqliteAdmin — never accepts a tenant-scoped token, since this package has one shared credential and no per-database scoping.",
